<title>USA: U.S. DAP prices flat, supported by China talk.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP prices flat, supported by China talk.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate prices were steady Monday, underpinned somewhat by talk of China buying DAP for spot shipment, cash sources said.</p>
<p>&quot;This China export business is what we need to support the market in the near term,&quot; one fertilizer analyst said.</p>
<p>Demand in the U.S. has been slowed by wet weather in the Midwest which limited fall applications, trade sources said.</p>
<p>			   Dlrs/short ton	Chg from Friday</p>
